# Extra search config for ripgrep and VS Code search (not read by git).
# These take precedence over .gitignore, letting searches from the top level
# find matches in the site repo's main docs (if site/ is checked out here),
# while git continues to ignore site/ entirely.
!/site/
/site/*
!/site/src/
/site/src/*
!/site/src/*.md
# also the archived manuals in the versioned dirs (site/src/1.52/ etc).
# The dir must be un-ignored first: a file can't be re-included if its
# parent dir is excluded.
!/site/src/[0-9]*/
/site/src/[0-9]*/*
!/site/src/[0-9]*/*.md
